OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 27 MAY
OL,4,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,5,     GKristiina Poska conducts the
OL,6,     GNorwegian Radio Orchestra in
OL,7,     GSibelius' two last symphonies. In
OL,8,     Gbetween, Shostakovich's energetic
OL,9,     GConcerto for Piano and Trumpet.
OL,10,G0630FBreakfast
OL,11,     GAl Ryan presents Radio 3's
OL,12,     GBreakfast show. To get in touch,
OL,13,     Gemail 3breakfast@bbc.co.uk.
OL,14,G0930FEssential Classics
OL,15,     GIan Skelly plays the best in
OL,16,     Gclassical music for your morning,
OL,17,     Gwith discoveries and surprises
OL,18,     Grubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,19,     Gfavourites.
